# Cross-boundary handle for the NVIDIA hubcore daemon (vendor process).
# hubcore is unusual: vendor/hubcore.te declares it with both `domain` and
# `service_manager_type`, so the same type plays both roles. The attribute
# below is enough for the platform-side references (binder_call,
# service_manager:find) because attributes resolve through both classes.
# See sepolicy/public/ussrd.te for the broader design rationale.
attribute hubcore_domain;
